  "Current result: 0.31204991 mm": "Nåværende resultat: 0.31204991 mm",
  "Pin-jointed straight axial members with common EA, small displacements and linear elasticity. Members have no bending stiffness, self-weight or thermal strain.": "Rette, leddkoblede aksialstaver med felles EA, små forskyvninger og lineær elastisitet. Stavene har ingen bøyestivhet, egenvekt eller termisk tøyning.",
  "The pinned joint restrains x and y; the second support restrains y only. Unconnected joints, duplicate members and mechanisms are rejected. Crossing bars are connected only at an explicitly shared joint.": "Leddopplageret holder x og y, det andre opplageret bare y. Frakoblede knutepunkter, dupliserte staver og mekanismer avvises. Kryssende staver kobles bare ved et uttrykkelig felles knutepunkt.",
  "The direct-stiffness equations Ku=F are solved on free degrees of freedom. Member force EAΔL/L is positive in tension. Reactions include only constrained degrees of freedom.": "Den direkte stivhetsmetodens Ku=F løses for frie frihetsgrader. Stavkraft EAΔL/L er positiv i strekk. Reaksjoner omfatter bare fastholdte frihetsgrader.",
  "This is an elastic teaching model, without member buckling, joint strength, material yielding or a structural acceptance check.": "Elastisk undervisningsmodell uten stavknekking, knutepunktstyrke, flyting eller konstruksjonsgodkjenning.",
