  "Each segment has hL=(fL/D+ΣK)v²/(2g). Enter the Darcy friction factor, not the Fanning factor. The supplied factors are held constant as flow changes.": "Hvert segment har hL=(fL/D+ΣK)v²/(2g). Oppgi Darcy-friksjonsfaktor, ikke Fanning-faktor. Faktorene holdes konstante når volumstrømmen endres.",
  "Parallel branches share head loss and their flows add through the common pipe. Series segments carry equal flow and their losses add. Laminar transition, pressure-dependent valves, cavitation and pump dynamics are excluded.": "Parallelle grener deler høydetap, og strømningene summeres i fellesrøret. Seriekoblede segmenter har lik volumstrøm, og tapene summeres. Laminær overgang, trykkavhengige ventiler, kavitasjon og pumpedynamikk inngår ikke.",
