  "Harmonic distortion": "Harmonisk forvrengning",
  "A waveform has fundamental RMS voltage 10 V, second harmonic 0.6 V and third harmonic 0.8 V, with no other harmonics. Find THD in percent.": "En bølge har grunntone 10 V RMS, andre harmoniske 0.6 V og tredje 0.8 V uten andre harmoniske. Finn THD i prosent.",
